        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ MR-PFSF Grade 1 Commercial Mortise Lock Sets</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe PDQ MR-PFSF series extra heavy duty mortise locksets conform to Federal Specification FF-H-106 Type 86. The latchbolt can be fully retracted with 35 degree lever rotation. They have a limited  <b>lifetime manufacturer's warranty</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nComplies with ANSI A156.13-2002, Series 1000, Grade 1. Listed by UL / ULC for ratings of “A”  label (3 hours) and less, UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, for single doors up to 4’0” x 8’0”.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWindstorm Resistant Product Listed - ANSI A250.13-2003, ASTM E1886-02, ASTM E330-02, Outswing: 350 ft-lbs., Inswing: N/R, Design Load Rating: 2453 lbf. (Functions with deadbolts only).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Assembled in the USA meeting the requirements of the <b>Buy American Act</b>. ADA compliant levers are solid cast, with no plastic inserts.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the PDQ MR Series Mortise Leversets:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mortise Case: 5-7/8\" x 4-1/8\" x 7/8\". 13-gauge heavy duty wrought steel. Zinc and clear chromate for corrosion resistance. One case size for all functions.</li>\r\n<li>Armored Front: 8\" x 1-1/4\". Brass or stainless steel. ANSI Standard A115.1. Adjustable from flat to beveled 1/8\" in 2\" bevel.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" -2-1/4\" thick. <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact us</b> for thicker doors.</a></li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt (for deadbolt functions): 9/16\" x 1-1/4\". 1\" throw. Stainless steel.</li>\r\n<li>Guardbolt: Stainless steel. Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 3/4\" Throw / Investment Cast Stainless Steel /Anti-friction Standard</li>\r\n<li>Stop Works: Stainless steel. Rocker type.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard mortise 86 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hand Case: Handed. Reversible in field.</li>\r\n<li>Front: 2-1/4\" X 1-1/8\" Beveled 1/8\" on 2\".</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" x 3/32\" (ASA). Stainless steel or brass.</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Trim: Philadelphia levers solid zinc diecast.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Keyways: Schlage \"C\" Standard.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Brass 6-pin cylinder keyed to 5 pins; 1-1/8\" long standard mortise lock cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Certifications: ANSI A156.13, Series 1000, Grade 1. Meets all accessibility requirements of the ADA. Conforms to Federal Specifications FF-H-106 Type 86.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: Limited lifetime manufacture warranty</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MR-lock-template.pdf?v=1704262259\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ MR Series Mortise Lock Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
